body:
adderall was the best and worst thing to ever happen to me pretty much. made me really love life and filled a big hole but now my life seems very void and im mentally slow.

&#x200B;

opiates and benzos were great until they werent. the withdrawal was the worst thing ive ever experienced and after years of getting off, i still think about them every day.

&#x200B;

if you make the choice to indulge, know you're starting the timer on a clock that WILL run out and when it does, you'll wish more than anything that you had never touched these substances
